// Conformance fixture for ta.ema (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.17, Wave 5B-1).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed
// deterministically by running this script's EMA formula against a
// hard-coded synthetic close series (see ta_ema.csv `close` column).
// Warmup: first (length-1) bars = NA; length-th bar seeded with
// SMA(source, length); subsequent bars use α = 2/(length+1) recursion.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_ema", overlay=true)
plot(ta.ema(close, 3), title="ema3")
